<Base title="Affiliate disclosure | VibeVerdict" description="How VibeVerdict uses affiliate links, and why verdicts are never for sale.">
<h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p>Some links on VibeVerdict are affiliate links. If you sign up or buy through one, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. Affiliate links open in a new tab and use <code>rel="sponsored nofollow noopener"</code>.</p>
<p>A Visit button uses an affiliate link only when that tool has one. Otherwise it goes to the vendor's official site. The same rule applies when a tool appears in another tool's alternatives list.</p>
<p><b>Verdicts are never for sale.</b> A commission, sponsorship, or partnership does not change a rating, a price, or a one-line verdict. Worth it, Depends, Skip, and Pending are editorial judgments. We publish the price we verified and the date we checked it, whether or not an affiliate link exists.</p>
<p>Read <a href="/about/">how we rate</a>.</p>
</Base>
